  "description": "读书学习智能体：PDF/EPUB 解析 + RAG 检索 + 结构化总结",
  "type": "module",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "npm run pi",
    "pi": "node --env-file=.env ./node_modules/@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent/dist/bundle/cli.js",
